# The release the upgrade test (tests/ci/upgrade-test.sh) updates from: the
# package as published on https://github.com/codeling/bfstop/releases, with
# its SHA-256 - what the test installs is code from that download, so it has
# to be the package that was checked. After a release, put the new one here:
